---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes by Erland Hilman Fuadi (Edd) on ML systems, efficient training, and the systems questions behind language model research.
isBlog: true
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Thinking out loud</p><h1>Notes &amp; writing<span class="name-dot">.</span></h1><p class="byline">By {{ site.blogAuthor }}</p><a class="subtle-link" href="/feed.xml">Subscribe via RSS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
{% if collections.posts.length %}
<div class="post-list">{% for post in collections.posts %}<article class="post-row"><div class="post-row-label">{% if post.data.image %}<a class="publication-thumbnail" href="{{ post.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" width="1462" height="770" loading="lazy"></a>{% endif %}<time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | displayDate }}</time></div><div>{% if post.data.draft %}<span class="draft-label">Draft</span>{% endif %}<h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2><span class="post-meta">{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min read{% if post.data.topic %} · {{ post.data.topic }}{% endif %}</span></div></article>{% endfor %}</div>
{% else %}
<section class="empty-state"><span class="empty-number" aria-hidden="true">01 /</span><h2>Every idea starts with a note.</h2><p>The first entry is still to come. I plan to write about efficient and distributed training, and how choices in model architecture and training objectives interact with the systems that run them.</p><div class="topic-list"><span>ML systems</span><span>Efficient training</span><span>Paper walkthroughs</span></div></section>
{% endif %}
<aside class="closing-note">Have a paper or a question you’d like to discuss? <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Send me a note.</a></aside>
